SUMMARY:Fallin Leaves Festival
DESCRIPTION:As the leaves begin to change their colors and slowly fall from the trees we welcome the return of SunRidge Charter School’s beloved Falling Leaves Festival.\nJoin us in celebrating the season with live music\, delicious wholesome food by Tacos de Pepe\, treats\, crafts to make\, games to play\, and a Handmade Marketplace to help you get started in your holiday shopping.\nSaturday November 7th\n11am-3pm\nFree entry and open to the community!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/fallin-leaves-festival-2/
LOCATION:Sunridge Charter School\, 7285 Hayden St\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
CATEGORIES:Crafting,Early Childhood (0-4),Festivals,Food & Drink,Holiday,Music
