SUMMARY:Poetic Medicine: An Instrument for Healing
DESCRIPTION:A MONTHLY SACRED SPACE AT THE SEBASTOPOL CENTER FOR THE ARTS—Every 2nd Tuesday of the month\, 4-5:30 pm \nLISTENING TO AND WRITING POEMS IN COMMUNITY\nYou do not have to be a “poet” or “writer” !!! \nCome join Poet/Author/Palliative Care Nurse\, Redwing Keyssar RN\,– and a community of folks who have been showing up for a year– in this healing experience of allowing words to flow through us. She has been leading “poetic medicine” sessions through her work in Palliative Care at UCSF since 2020 and now brings this creative expression to Sebastopol!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/poetic-medicine-an-instrument-for-healing-2/2026-11-10/
