SUMMARY:Ukrainian and American Friendship: A Musical Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Join Nina Gerber\, Tom Rigney and Flambeau\, The Pulsators with special guest Sebastian St. James\, and Jim Corbett and the Love Choir as they unite with Ukrainian musicians in a benefit concert for Ukrainian children whose parents were killed fighting in the war against Russia. Send a message to Ukrainians everywhere that in spite of what the President says\, Americans stand with Ukraine and have not forgotten them.
