SUMMARY:Festive Wreath Making Class with Flower Casita at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy\, hands-on afternoon celebrating the colors and textures of the autumn season at our gorgeous Apple Cottage. We are thrilled to partner with the botanical experts from Flower Casita in Petaluma to guide you through crafting your very own holiday masterpiece. \nUsing an array of fresh seasonal greens\, vibrant autumn leaves\, and rich botanical textures\, you will learn step-by-step techniques to construct a stunning\, festive wreath. Your beautiful creation will be complete and ready to take home—perfectly timed to hang on your door and welcome guests for your Thanksgiving festivities! \nThe experience also includes a guided tour of our farm aboard our apple trolley. To keep things festive and warm\, you’ll be treated to a slice of freshly baked apple pie and a mug of warm apple cider.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/festive-wreath-making-class-with-flower-casita-at-gold-ridge-organic-farms/
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms\, 3387 Canfield Rd\, Sebastopol\, 95472
