SUMMARY:Start your family tree: Discover your family’s story
DESCRIPTION:This free talk and hands-on session will enable you to:\n– Build a family tree in minutes\n– Search census and military records\n– Find birth\, marriage and death records\n– Explore historic newspapers\n– Trace your ancestry back hundreds of years \nYou will leave the session with your family tree started! This event is presented by Michael Von der Porten\, a sixth-generation Sonoma County resident\, historian\, researcher\, author\, and tour guide. This is a project from the Western Sonoma County Historical Society. It will be preceded by an update by the Historical Society\, including the latest about the West County Museum and the Luther Burbank Experiment Farm. \nWhat to Bring:\n– Full name of a parent\, grandparent\, or earlier ancestor\n– Birth date\n– Death date (if applicable)\n– Place of birth\nNote: We’ll begin with deceased family members for privacy reasons.
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/start-your-family-tree-discover-your-familys-story/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Center for the Arts\, 282 S High Street\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Adults, generally,Education,Free,History/Culture
