SUMMARY:Meet the Maker: Emily Luchetti at Gold Ridge Organic Farms
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we welcome James Beard Award-winning pastry chef Emily Luchetti to our Farm Shop as she samples her Sweet Queen line of artisanal fruit spreads and caramels. Entry is free (no need to RSVP) \nEmily will show you how her flavors pair with other local\, seasonal favorites\, and how to use them to elevate your holiday menus and festive gatherings. \nIn addition to being a treat for your tastebuds\, these exceptional products make perfect holiday gifts for friends and family.
